<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Student Journey</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f4f7ff;
            color: #222;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background: #4f46e5;
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        section {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #4f46e5;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .skill {
            background: #eef2ff;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #222;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🚀 My Student Journey</h1>
        <p>My first step into the world of coding</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>👋 About Me</h2>
        <p>
            I am a student passionate about learning, technology,
            creativity and building a better future.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>🎯 My Goals</h2>
        <p>
            I want to keep learning new skills, explore technology,
            understand AI and create useful digital projects.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>💡 Things I Like</h2>

        <div class="skills">
            <div class="skill">📚 Learning</div>
            <div class="skill">💻 Coding</div>
            <div class="skill">🤖 AI</div>
            <div class="skill">🎨 Design</div>
            <div class="skill">🚀 Technology</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>🌱 My First Code</h2>
        <p>
            Today I created my first webpage using HTML and CSS.
            This is just the beginning!
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>#MyFirstCode | My coding journey starts here 🚀</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
